WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.181 --> 00:00:01.190
Welcome back!

2
00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:02.410
Before we say goodbye

3
00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:05.379
we like to play a quick game of Drewth or Dare!

4
00:00:05.379 --> 00:00:08.330
(audience cheering)

5
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.830
You can ask me to do anything

6
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.690
or dare me to do anything.

7
00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.480
And today we have Kristin.

8
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.630 line:15%
Hi Kristin.

9
00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.867 line:15%
Hi Drew. Hello

10
00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:18.760 line:15%
Drewth or dare?

11
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:19.750 line:15%
Dare.

12
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.632 line:15%
Okay, everybody does Drewth. Go for it.

13
00:00:21.632 --> 00:00:24.760 line:15%
You are such an inspiration to all women

14
00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.790
and I love your Instagram feed.

15
00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.090
And I dare you to take a picture with me

16
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.740
for your Instagram feed.

17
00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.310
It would be my honor and my pleasure

18
00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:36.256
to take a picture with you.

19
00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:39.104
(audience cheering)

20
00:00:39.104 --> 00:00:40.404
Before I start crying.

21
00:00:40.404 --> 00:00:42.793
We're going to take a digital picture.

22
00:00:44.017 --> 00:00:46.020
Kayla, would you mind taking our picture?

23
00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:49.502
By the way, Kayla your outfit today is killing me.

24
00:00:49.502 --> 00:00:50.634
Thank you.

25
00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:53.634
(audience cheering)

26
00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:57.090
That was a beautiful dare.

27
00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.360
Thank you Kristin, so much.

28
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.043
Well, guess what Kristin?

29
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.600
In a few minutes you're gonna have to check our feed

30
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:08.293
because we'll be on it together.

31
00:01:08.293 --> 00:01:10.077
I love it! I love it. Thank you.

32
00:01:10.077 --> 00:01:13.560
Oh, thank you for choosing to spend your time with us.

33
00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.623
We make this show for you so take it with you.

34
00:01:18.325 --> 00:01:20.908 line:15%
(upbeat music)

